From 2fe7ca26e59b430efdc8dcead37a7e0760354419 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:44:09 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(post): assign stable tool numbers on add, import, and
 project load

Assign the lowest unused controller tool number in 1-99999 at tool
creation (`AddTool`, `ImportTools`) instead of falling back to the
tool's alphabetical list rank. Freeze unnumbered tools in legacy project
files to their 1-based name-sorted rank during load, and refuse clearing
a tool's number back to `None`.

Fixes #2442
